<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Tinsel" data-copy-zh="Tinsel">Tinsel</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Tinsel through the Christmas encounter chain, unlock her tavern, and plan repeat visits and gifts." data-copy-zh="沿圣诞遭遇线找到 Tinsel，开放她的酒馆，查清日常拜访与赠礼要求。">Find Tinsel through the Christmas encounter chain, unlock her tavern, and plan repeat visits and gifts.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Tinsel at a glance</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Open Tinsel Tavern</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Follow the Christmas encounter chain</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Conversation and gifts</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If you get stuck</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">先认识 Tinsel</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">怎么开放 Tinsel 酒馆</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">先完成这条圣诞事件链</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">每天能做什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查这些地方</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">接下来可以查阅</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><h2>Tinsel at a glance</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Tinsel — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinsel-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Tinsel — character portrait." decoding="async" height="470" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinsel.webp" width="470"/></a><figcaption>Tinsel — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Tinsel is a sarcastic, warm-hearted Christmas elf. Her dungeon encounters lead to a permanent meeting place at <strong>Tinsel Tavern in Christmas Village</strong>, where you can continue her relationship through conversation and gifts.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Open Tinsel Tavern</h2><p>The tavern needs <strong>both the completed Krampus rescue and the 2026 Christmas code redeemed</strong>. You can meet these two requirements in either order. The older Christmas event unlock alone does not open this tavern.</p><p>Once both are complete, visit <strong>Future → Fringe Zone → Christmas Village → Tinsel Tavern</strong>. The tavern travel action costs no time. Tinsel is there <strong>all day, every day</strong>; open her portrait for personal actions.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Follow the Christmas encounter chain</h2><p>Turn <strong>Christmas Spirit ON</strong> for the alley and dungeon encounter chain, then check these four tasks on Holly’s list. They form their own sequence; you do not have to complete every intervening task number to advance this chain.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">Where / requirement</th><th scope="col">Result to check</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Holly Task 18</th><td data-label="Where / requirement">Explore Back Alleys in Medieval → Kings Demesne, with Christmas Spirit ON</td><td data-label="Result to check">Finish the stranded-elf encounter</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Task 19</th><td data-label="Where / requirement">Normal dungeon Floor 18 or above; Task 18 complete</td><td data-label="Result to check">First Tinsel dungeon encounter complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Task 20</th><td data-label="Where / requirement">Normal dungeon Floor 21 or above; Task 19 complete</td><td data-label="Result to check">Second Tinsel dungeon encounter complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Task 25</th><td data-label="Where / requirement">Normal dungeon Floor 23 or above; Task 20 complete</td><td data-label="Result to check">Finish the Krampus rescue; 3 Christmas Tokens</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The three dungeon meetings are random encounters. If one does not appear immediately, keep exploring the listed normal floor with the previous task complete. Use Floors <strong>18, 21 and 23</strong> as the earliest places to work on the three stages; the Underworld on Floors 51–60 does not roll these scenes. Prepare for a boss battle before looking for the final stage.</p><p>After the rescue, ordinary tavern visits are the way to keep raising her relationship. Her earlier illustrated encounters are one-time content; there are no separate formal date or Heart-to-Heart invitations.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Conversation and gifts</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Unlock</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Base affection</th><th scope="col">Daily allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Tinsel</th><td data-label="Unlock">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost">25 min</td><td data-label="Base affection">1</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Unlock">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost">20 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Base affection">3</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Hot Chocolate</th><td data-label="Unlock">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost">20 min; 1 Hot Chocolate</td><td data-label="Base affection">10</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">80</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each action has its own allowance. Hot Chocolate uses the <strong>Christmas Hot Chocolate resource</strong>; regular Chocolate is a different gift. The large Hot Chocolate allowance still requires enough supplies and time for each visit.</p><p>The listed affection is the base reward before bonuses. Tinsel responds well to <strong>Charm 50, Perception 50 and Stamina 70</strong>. The <strong>Christmas Spirit skill</strong> improves her affection gains.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>If you get stuck</h2><dl><dt><strong>The tavern is missing after the rescue.</strong></dt><dd>Confirm the 2026 Christmas redemption as well as Task 25. These are separate requirements; the tavern can open whichever one you finish last.</dd><dt><strong>Finding the elf in the alleys did not open the tavern.</strong></dt><dd>That completes Task 18. Continue through the two dungeon meetings and the rescue in the table.</dd><dt><strong>The next dungeon encounter will not appear.</strong></dt><dd>Check Christmas Spirit is ON and the previous task is marked complete, then explore the relevant normal floor. Later meetings do not replace unfinished earlier encounters.</dd><dt><strong>Give Hot Chocolate is unavailable.</strong></dt><dd>Reach Known and check the Christmas Hot Chocolate counter. A regular Chocolate item supplies the other gift action.</dd><dt><strong>More gifts are no longer helping.</strong></dt><dd>Respect the separate daily allowances and return on another game day. Repeated attempts can waste gifts or upset her.</dd></dl></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Christmas Village — event access, Holly’s tasks and resources</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon — normal floors and battle preparation</a></li><li><a href="character-holly.html">Holly — Christmas task progress</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — stages and bonuses</a></li><li><a href="items.html">Items — gifts and consumables</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><h2>先认识 Tinsel</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Tinsel 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinsel-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Tinsel 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="470" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinsel.webp" width="470"/></a><figcaption>Tinsel 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Tinsel 是嘴上爱挖苦、相处起来却很温暖的圣诞精灵。她的地下城事件会带你找到固定的见面地点：<strong>圣诞村的 Tinsel 酒馆</strong>。酒馆开放后，可以通过交谈与赠礼继续培养感情。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>怎么开放 Tinsel 酒馆</h2><p>酒馆需要同时满足两个条件：<strong>完成 Krampus 救援</strong>，并<strong>兑换 2026 圣诞兑换码</strong>，先后顺序不限。只开放旧的圣诞活动，还不足以进入这间酒馆。</p><p>条件齐全后，前往<strong>未来 → 边缘区 → 圣诞村 → Tinsel的酒馆</strong>。前往酒馆不消耗时间，Tinsel<strong>每天全天都在这里</strong>，点开头像即可选择个人行动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>先完成这条圣诞事件链</h2><p>将<strong>圣诞精神设为开启</strong>，再对照 Holly 的任务清单推进下表。这四项有自己的前后关系，不必先做完它们之间所有编号的任务。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">步骤</th><th scope="col">地点／条件</th><th scope="col">完成后检查</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Holly 第 18 项任务</th><td data-label="地点／条件">开启圣诞精神，在中世纪国王领地的后巷选择「探索后巷」</td><td data-label="完成后检查">完整结束受困精灵事件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第 19 项任务</th><td data-label="地点／条件">普通地下城最早第 18 层；已完成第 18 项</td><td data-label="完成后检查">完成第一次 Tinsel 地下城事件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第 20 项任务</th><td data-label="地点／条件">普通地下城最早第 21 层；已完成第 19 项</td><td data-label="完成后检查">完成第二次 Tinsel 地下城事件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第 25 项任务</th><td data-label="地点／条件">普通地下城最早第 23 层；已完成第 20 项</td><td data-label="完成后检查">完成 Krampus 救援；获得 3 圣诞代币</td></tr></tbody></table><p>三次地下城相遇都有随机性，没有立刻遇到时，可以确认前一项任务已完成，再继续探索表中的普通楼层。第一次最早在<strong>第 18 层</strong>，第二次在<strong>第 21 层</strong>，最后阶段在<strong>第 23 层</strong>；第 51–60 层的冥界区域不会出现这些事件。寻找最后阶段前，先做好首领战的准备。</p><p>完成救援后，到酒馆交谈与送礼即可继续提高好感。之前的插图事件都只需完成一次；酒馆没有另外的正式约会或谈心邀请。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>每天能做什么</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">开放阶段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">基础好感</th><th scope="col">每日次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Tinsel聊天</th><td data-label="开放阶段">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="消耗">25 分钟</td><td data-label="基础好感">1</td><td data-label="每日次数">7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">赠送巧克力</th><td data-label="开放阶段">相识（Acquaintance，50）</td><td data-label="消耗">20 分钟；1 巧克力</td><td data-label="基础好感">3</td><td data-label="每日次数">7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送热巧克力</th><td data-label="开放阶段">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="消耗">20 分钟；1 热巧克力</td><td data-label="基础好感">10</td><td data-label="每日次数">80</td></tr></tbody></table><p>三种行动的每日次数分别计算。「送热巧克力」使用<strong>圣诞热巧克力资源</strong>，普通巧克力用于另一项赠礼。热巧克力的次数上限较高，每次仍要准备相应资源与时间。</p><p>表中是基础好感，实际获得量还会受到加成影响。她偏好的属性是<strong>魅力 50、感知 50、耐力 70</strong>，学会<strong>圣诞精神</strong>技能也有助于提高好感收益。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查这些地方</h2><dl><dt><strong>救援完成了，酒馆却没有出现。</strong></dt><dd>再检查是否已经兑换 2026 圣诞兑换码。它与第 25 项任务是两个条件，补齐最后一项后即可开放。</dd><dt><strong>后巷已经找到精灵，为什么还不能去酒馆？</strong></dt><dd>那是第 18 项任务。接下来还需要两次地下城相遇，再完成表中的救援阶段。</dd><dt><strong>下一次地下城事件一直不出现。</strong></dt><dd>确认圣诞精神已开启、前一项任务已经勾选，再到相应普通楼层探索。后面的相遇不会替代尚未完成的前置事件。</dd><dt><strong>不能选择「送热巧克力」。</strong></dt><dd>达到已知（Known，25 点）后，再检查圣诞热巧克力计数。普通巧克力用于另一项赠礼。</dd><dt><strong>继续送礼不再有效。</strong></dt><dd>留意各项行动分别计算的每日次数，等下一个游戏日再来；反复尝试可能浪费礼物，也可能让她不高兴。</dd></dl></section>
<section id="zh-related"><h2>接下来可以查阅</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">圣诞村：活动入口、Holly 的任务与资源</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城：普通楼层与战斗准备</a></li><li><a href="character-holly.html">Holly：圣诞任务进度</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系：阶段与加成</a></li><li><a href="items.html">道具：礼物与消耗品</a></li></ul></section>
